{"id":"33052f37223a11c6","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-cfg-structure.md","title":"Context-Free Grammar","display":"df-context-free-grammar — Context-Free Grammar","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-cfg-structure","aliases":["73-df-cfg-structure","73-df-context-free-grammar"],"display":"df-context-free-grammar — Context-Free Grammar","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-cfg-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-cfg-structure</span><span>73-df-context-free-grammar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-context-free-grammar — Context-Free Grammar"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (terminal alphabet, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (candidate grammar tuple)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CFG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists V\\,\\exists P\\,\\exists S\\;\\Bigl(\nG=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\land\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)\\land V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\\land\nP\\subseteq V\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\land |P|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\nS\\in V\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CFG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists V\\,\\exists P\\,\\exists S\\;\\Bigl(\nG=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\land\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)\\land V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\\land\nP\\subseteq V\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\land |P|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\nS\\in V\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{G:\\operatorname{CFG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{G:\\operatorname{CFG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A production <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,\\gamma)\\in P\">\\((A,\\gamma)\\in P\\)</span> is written <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to\\gamma\">\\(A\\to\\gamma\\)</span>; its left side is exactly one nonterminal, which is the context-free restriction.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","sta